<?php

/*
 * Harvester policy for the AI pilot.
 *
 * A lost fleet leaves debris, but debris is only worth buying a recycler for
 * when it is heavy enough to pay for the hull. These are the knobs a modder
 * turns to change when the pilot buys harvesters and how many it buys at once;
